  "adaptation": "Public cuDNN conv_cpu_ref is applied independently to single-input/single-output-channel groups, with cross-correlation, unit stride/dilation and radius padding. Expand spatial coordinate helpers into loops, remove the singleton channel reduction, and use broadcast bias for beta=1. Odd filter extents are represented as 2*radius+1. The adapter calls grouped cudnnConvolutionForward and cudnnAddTensor.",
